    @Test void sourceFixedPathConflictAllReasonsAndExactBinary(){long b=book();String key=sourceCopy(b);source(b,key,"{\"套装类型\":\"套装中单本\",\"原书籍信息\":\"不返回的合成原文\"}");assertEquals("MEMBER_MARKER",context(b).path("source").path("markerState").asText());JsonNode p=preview(create(newMember(b)));jdbc.update("UPDATE legacy_record SET details_json=? WHERE source_key=?","{\"套装类型\":\"套装中单本\",\"无关\":\"仅改变无关路径\"}",key);assertTrue(confirm(p).path("changed").asBoolean());assertTrue(service.reviews(q("keyword",intake.read(b).getIsbn()),admin).path("total").asLong()>0);source(b,sourceCopy(b),"{\"套装类型\":null}");JsonNode summary=context(b).path("source");assertEquals("CONFLICT",summary.path("markerState").asText());assertTrue(summary.path("reasons").toString().contains("INCOMPLETE_SOURCE_VALUE"));assertTrue(summary.path("reasons").toString().contains("MEMBER_MARKER_NO_PARENT"));source(b,"unmatched-"+UUID.randomUUID(),"{\"套装类型\":\" 未识别 \"}");assertEquals("ASSOCIATION_INVALID",context(b).path("source").path("associationState").asText());JsonNode detail=service.sourceDetails(q("caseKey","SET_SOURCE_BOOK:"+b,"size","1","page","2"),admin);assertEquals(3,detail.path("total").asLong());assertEquals(1,detail.path("records").size());assertFalse(detail.toString().contains("原书籍信息"));jdbc.update("INSERT INTO legacy_record(source_system,record_type,source_key,book_id,details_json,display_name) VALUES ('huiben ','BOOK',?,?,?,'合成B34来源')","wrong-system-"+b,b,"{\"套装类型\":\"套装中单本\"}");assertEquals(3,context(b).path("source").path("sourceCount").asLong());}
    @Test void sourceTypesUnicodeWrongRootAndOrphans(){Map<String,String> values=new LinkedHashMap<>();values.put("{}","MISSING");values.put("{\"套装类型\":null}","NULL");values.put("{\"套装类型\":\"\"}","EMPTY");values.put("{\"套装类型\":\" \"}","WHITESPACE");values.put("{\"套装类型\":\"   　\"}","WHITESPACE");values.put("{\"套装类型\":\"暂无设置\"}","UNSET");values.put("[]","WRONG_TYPE");values.put("broken","WRONG_TYPE");values.put("{\"套装类型\":123}","WRONG_TYPE");values.put("{\"套装类型\":\"套装中单本 \"}","UNMAPPED");for(var e:values.entrySet()){long b=book();source(b,sourceCopy(b),e.getKey());assertEquals(e.getValue(),context(b).path("source").path("markerState").asText());assertEquals(1,service.reviews(q("scope","ALL","keyword",intake.read(b).getIsbn(),"markerState",e.getValue()),admin).path("total").asLong());}long orphan=source(null,"ORPHAN"+UUID.randomUUID(),"{\"套装类型\":\"套装中单本\"}");JsonNode detail=service.sourceDetails(q("caseKey","SET_SOURCE_RECORD:"+orphan),admin);assertEquals(1,detail.path("total").asLong());boolean found=false;for(int page=1;;page++){JsonNode list=service.reviews(q("bookDeleted","ALL","relationshipState","NONE","size","100","page",""+page),admin);for(JsonNode row:list.path("records"))if(row.path("caseKey").asText().equals("SET_SOURCE_RECORD:"+orphan))found=true;if(found||page>=list.path("pages").asInt())break;}assertTrue(found);}
    @Test void source201HasFullDigestAccurateCountAndRejectsMemberPreview(){long b=book();for(int i=0;i<201;i++)source(b,"SYNTHETIC201-"+b+"-"+i,"{\"套装类型\":\"套装中单本\"}");JsonNode c=context(b);assertEquals(201,c.path("source").path("sourceCount").asLong());assertTrue(c.path("source").path("reasons").toString().contains("SOURCE_LIMIT_EXCEEDED"));reason("SOURCE_LIMIT_EXCEEDED",()->preview(create(newMember(b))));JsonNode p=service.sourceDetails(q("caseKey","SET_SOURCE_BOOK:"+b,"page","3","size","100"),admin);assertEquals(1,p.path("records").size());assertEquals(c.path("source").path("digest"),p.get("evidenceDigest"));}
